  4262                                  ; at least one command, stores the alias and returns al=1 (caller
  4263                                  ; should treat the line as fully handled and not process it further).
  4264                                  ; Otherwise returns al=0 and leaves line_buf untouched, so the caller
  4265                                  ; processes the line normally.
