  4459                                  ; cmd_alias_invoke: called from dispatch when cmd_buf matched an alias
  4460                                  ; name, with [alias_match_idx] set to that alias's table index. Runs
  4461                                  ; the alias's stored body exactly like a freshly-typed line, through
  4462                                  ; the same chain processor (process_chain or process_chain_rr) that's
  4463                                  ; currently active, so ; chaining and ~ piping inside the alias work
