  5526                                  ; ata_select_device: al = device id (0=primary master, 1=primary slave,
  5527                                  ; 2=secondary master, 3=secondary slave). Picks the I/O port base and the
  5528                                  ; drive-select bit so every ATA routine below talks to the right drive.
