  8481                                  ; ============================================================
  8482                                  ;  complete_line: Tab completion for the rush prompt. Called from
  8483                                  ;  read_line when the user presses Tab.
  8484                                  ;  - first token on the line: completes against the built-in command
  8485                                  ;    table (completion_cmds)
