  8489                                  ;  space, folders a trailing '/'); an ambiguous prefix is extended as
  8490                                  ;  far as all candidates agree, and if the prefix is already as long as
  8491                                  ;  the shared portion, the candidates are listed and the prompt and
  8492                                  ;  line are reprinted.
